OL,3,GNEWSALaura Anne Jones elected Reform's
OL,4,Adeputy Welsh leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaura Anne Jones has been elected
OL,7,FReform's new deputy leader in Wales,
OL,8,Fthe party has announced.
OL,10,FThe post was vacated after the previous
OL,11,Fdeputy Helen Jenner took the party's
OL,12,FSenedd leadership on Tuesday.
OL,14,FIn a statement, Jones said: "We've made
OL,15,Fa fantastic start here in the Senedd,
OL,16,Fgiving a voice to the voiceless and
OL,17,Fstanding up for Wales' left-behind
OL,18,Fcommunities."
OL,20,FReform has not announced further
OL,21,Fdetails of the election, including
OL,22,Fother candidates.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
